BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:af4e4283-d149-4466-903b-7199ebc49e82@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Parent Connect: Connected or Overloaded? Supporting Children & Teens Mental Health in Digital Age
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T200000
DESCRIPTION:A panel of experts\, including nationally recognized digital
  addiction specialist Dr. Edward Spector\, board-certified child and adole
 scent psychiatrist and author Dr. Shari Thomas\, and Emily Kircher-Morris\
 , M.A.\, M.Ed.\, LPC\, a nationally recognized speaker\, author\, and lice
 nsed professional counselor specializing in neurodiversity-affirming pract
 ice\, will explore strategies for promoting healthy development in the dig
 ital age.
LOCATION:Virtual #02
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
END:VEVENT
