SUMMARY:High School Integration Bee
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270317T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270317T200000
DESCRIPTION:The GDS Integration Bee is a tournament-style math competiti
 on with timed\, head-to-head matches on whiteboards facing an audience and
  live commentary to help everyone—no matter your mathematical background—f
 ollow what’s going on. We’ll also have musical interludes\, contestant bac
 kstories\, court-side interviews\, and much more.
LOCATION:G001 HS Forum
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8159f28a-33b0-41f8-8e52-0c2cacd96842@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Parent Connect: Managing Anxious Feelings
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270315T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270315T130000
DESCRIPTION:Author and psychologist Dr. Samantha Sweeney will share\nstr
 ategies to reduce anxious feelings in the moment and beyond. She is the co
 -author of Working with Worry and the author of Culturally Competent Kids.
 \n\nPlease contact Meryl Heyliger with questions: mheyliger@gds.org
LOCATION:Virtual #01
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c5280e75-f271-4526-909a-58c07a6f50f9@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Speaker Series: Behind the Headlines
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270315T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270315T210000
DESCRIPTION:Our guests will examine the increasingly complex relationshi
 p between the press and the presidency. They will discuss how the media na
 vigates its role as a democratic watchdog in an increasingly polarized pol
 itical climate. \n \nModerator: Adrienne LaFrance\, Executive Editor\, The
  Atlantic\n \nFeaturing: Jeffrey Goldberg\, Editor in Chief\, The Atlantic
 \; Meredith Kopit Levien\, President and CEO\, The New York Times Company\
 ; and Jennifer Griffin\, Chief National Security Correspondent\, FOX News 
 Channel
LOCATION:B201 LMS Flexible Performance Center
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
END:VEVENT
