DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T120000
DESCRIPTION:An opportunity for GDS running alumni to return and run agai
 n with former coaches\, teachers\, and current members of the GDS running 
 teams. Runners and walkers of all ages are encouraged to come out to parti
 cipate in this low-key\, free race along a flat course beside the beautifu
 l C & O Canal. No registration necessary.\n \n The race begins and ends in
  the Fletcher's Cove Boathouse parking lot (4940 Canal Rd NW\, Washington\
 , DC 20007 - Corner of Canal Road & Reservoir Road).\n Email: abelber@gds.
 org
LOCATION:Offsite #02
ORGANIZER;CN=Maria Rodriguez:mailto:mrodriguez@gds.org
END:VEVENT
